WEBVTT

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:06.070
Do Western warlords drink tea?

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:07.290
What?

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:09.710
Tea... you say?

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:12.740
I'll invite you to a tea party.

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:13.440
What?!

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.080
And I'll settle the score with you.

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:26.910
I accept that invitation.

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:29.590
Cease fire temporarily!

00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:31.560
Sheathe your weapons!

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:34.270
We will have a tea ceremony!

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:36.340
Make preparations!

00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:17.580
<i>Dawn has revealed the savage 
landscape beneath the Oda castle.</i>

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:20.860
<i>It was hell itself.</i>

00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:26.170
<i>Nobunaga has narrowly secured 
respite with a surprise move,</i>

00:02:26.170 --> 00:02:28.310
<i>by suggesting a
 "tea ceremony of warring nations."</i>

00:02:29.090 --> 00:02:35.750
<i>But it was not even to be
 a brief respite for friend or foe.</i>

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:47.720
<i>The events have also left deep, 
dark scars in Jeanne's heart.</i>

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:51.520
Send the wounded to battle positions.

00:02:51.960 --> 00:02:55.090
Prioritize women and children
 when granting leave from the castle.

00:02:55.090 --> 00:02:55.830
Understood.

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:01.560
The real battle begins now, Nobu.

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:04.460
Nobu has ensured

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:08.650
that this will be the worst of the damage.

00:03:09.070 --> 00:03:12.600
Well, I am not so sure we can say that.

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:18.930
It was clever of you to suggest 
the tea ceremony, Nobu-sama.

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:21.000
It came to me in the spur of the moment.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.200
If we had continued to wage war,

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:26.600
we would have been devastated.

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:30.260
Well, it wouldn't have
 been limited to our nation.

00:03:30.930 --> 00:03:32.960
It could have destroyed this entire star.

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:35.750
I am sorry.

00:03:36.120 --> 00:03:37.540
It wasn't your fault.

00:03:38.220 --> 00:03:39.970
My strategy was weak.

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:46.050
"Know your men well, or you
 will never win, even in 100 battles."

00:03:47.130 --> 00:03:48.650
Dad's words.

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:53.320
They made no impression on me back then,

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:56.270
but now, they are sacred. 
They carry a heavy weight.

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:59.410
Wars are not waged by myself alone...

00:04:00.950 --> 00:04:01.840
Nobu...

00:04:02.210 --> 00:04:04.500
If only I hadn't held him back.

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:09.360
I have learned his lesson the hard way.

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:12.580
What is your plan now?

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:16.960
I will figure Caesar out at the tea party.

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:21.860
I will confirm his... possibly even 
the Star of the West's intentions.

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:24.680
Would it be that easy to make him talk?

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:25.610
He's right.

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:29.620
Nobu, he may be planning to take your life.

00:04:30.190 --> 00:04:32.640
We've said to come to the 
tea ceremony unarmed.

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:34.450
Don't let your guard down.

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:38.360
You think Caesar will hold himself to that?

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:42.880
It is a good opportunity to test him.

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:45.570
Nobu, you...

00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:50.890
But the Oda were facing certain 
defeat in the battle beforehand.

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:55.390
The enemy will make numerous demands.

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:57.250
Yes, I know.

00:04:57.860 --> 00:05:01.400
He has always been after our Regalia.

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:06.640
What will you do if he asks for them?

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:08.980
Refuse, of course.

00:05:08.980 --> 00:05:11.090
If that was enough to make him give up,

00:05:11.090 --> 00:05:13.410
he wouldn't have started 
this war in the first place.

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:16.370
Remember what da Vinci said.

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:19.800
If I can say one thing:

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:23.650
those who control the Regalia,
 control the world.

00:05:24.860 --> 00:05:29.420
He must want someone with a strong 
will who can control the Regalia.

00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:32.100
That'd be you, right, Nobu-sama?

00:05:32.510 --> 00:05:35.860
It is true that if the Regalia 
were his only objective,

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:39.680
he could've killed
 Nobunaga during the battle.

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:44.890
I have thought of possible ways

00:05:44.890 --> 00:05:46.870
to counter him if he

00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:52.450
were to demand that the Regalia, 
or you yourself, submit to him.

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:54.640
Please give it a look.

00:05:55.180 --> 00:05:56.130
All right.

00:05:58.040 --> 00:05:59.120
Brother.

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:01.800
Oh, Ichi.

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:02.780
What is it?

00:06:02.780 --> 00:06:05.110
Ah, excuse me.

00:06:06.230 --> 00:06:10.970
I would like to show you the bowl 
we will be using at the tea ceremony.

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:22.940
The Bowl of Emptiness?

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:26.980
Yes, the inheritance I had 
been entrusted with by Father.

00:06:27.980 --> 00:06:30.330
I believe it is suitable 
for this tea ceremony.

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:35.890
I suppose we can ask Dad to watch over us.

00:06:36.260 --> 00:06:38.520
And, Nobukatsu, too, of course!

00:06:38.900 --> 00:06:39.770
Yes.

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:47.910
Brother, I will preside over 
the tea ceremony as the host.

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:49.740
I'll be counting on you, Ichi.

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:52.380
I understand.

00:06:55.520 --> 00:06:57.250
A tea party...

00:06:57.490 --> 00:07:00.650
Hey, Bianchi, what's a tea party?

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:03.750
Maybe it's like the salon 
events you see at court.

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:06.460
Maybe there'll be musicians and jesters!

00:07:06.460 --> 00:07:09.020
That sounds like it'll be fun.

00:07:09.020 --> 00:07:11.170
We can dance for the
 first time in a long while!

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:14.630
Nobunaga...

00:07:15.400 --> 00:07:16.940
At first, I intended to capture him

00:07:16.940 --> 00:07:19.690
and offer him to King Arthur 
along with the Regalia,

00:07:19.690 --> 00:07:24.080
or to defeat him and take 
the Regalia he had gathered.

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:28.040
But, if I can make him an ally...

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:30.910
I can defeat Alexander.

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:35.540
Besides, at the Oda castle...

00:07:35.540 --> 00:07:38.050
...there's the princess.

00:07:38.050 --> 00:07:39.450
Yeah.

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:44.040
She's really beautiful.

00:07:44.040 --> 00:07:46.010
I'm jealous.

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:52.900
Are you feeling down 
because of the tea party?

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:56.410
No, it's because of my shortcomings.

00:07:57.590 --> 00:07:58.910
Then...

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:11.170
The fool, an unwise one.

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:16.440
It signifies freedom, 
nonconformity, innocence,

00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:22.560
purity, cheer, possibility, 
imagination, and genius.

00:08:23.210 --> 00:08:27.890
The words belie the first impression 
one might have of a fool.

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:30.260
Just like Nobunaga...

00:08:31.810 --> 00:08:34.740
There are many tea schools,

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:35.650
but I heard they

00:08:35.650 --> 00:08:37.580
say that a tea ceremony is to be enjoyed.

00:08:38.170 --> 00:08:43.000
I wonder what mindset Sir Nobunaga 
will bring to the tea ceremony.

00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:50.590
Let us observe his most 
foolish behavior yet.

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:05.690
Ichi...

00:09:14.060 --> 00:09:16.820
You also often came here to

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:19.720
stand beneath the waterfall
 since you were little, Brother.

00:09:37.210 --> 00:09:40.510
And I found that you somehow joined me.

00:09:42.530 --> 00:09:46.250
You're staking your life 
on this tea ceremony.

00:09:46.710 --> 00:09:50.970
I felt I should not take the 
role of the host too lightly.

00:09:50.970 --> 00:09:52.750
Don't trouble yourself too much.

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:57.780
They do not know anything
 about our tea ceremony customs.

00:09:57.780 --> 00:09:59.530
It'd be impossible to slight them.

00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:01.610
Oh, you are right.

00:10:05.800 --> 00:10:06.850
Nobu.

00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:11.190
I'll do everything in my power

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:14.680
for the Oda clan and our people.

00:10:14.980 --> 00:10:17.430
That is my responsibility.

00:10:17.430 --> 00:10:18.420
Don't worry about it.

00:10:18.890 --> 00:10:20.900
No matter what happens,

00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:23.330
I will follow you from now on.

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:27.420
Like I said, you don't 
have to think that way.

00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:29.760
You should be more carefree about life.

00:10:30.460 --> 00:10:31.490
No,

00:10:32.220 --> 00:10:35.430
this is my strength.

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:38.370
You are such a troublemaker.

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:41.800
I am your sister.

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:15.140
Stay on guard.

00:11:15.140 --> 00:11:16.870
Knowing Caesar's army,

00:11:16.870 --> 00:11:18.970
they may try to make a 
move during the truce.

00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:22.250
We may be under truce, but stay alert.

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:24.980
Be ready to launch a full frontal assault.

00:11:27.480 --> 00:11:29.880
If there is any suspicious activity...

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:32.050
...inform Mitsuhide-sama.

00:11:32.050 --> 00:11:34.890
Should anything happen,
 we will deal with it on our end.

00:11:37.010 --> 00:11:38.980
Nobu does not know about this.

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:40.900
This is my personal decision.

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:46.100
If Caesar makes any suspicious 
movement, take immediate action.

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:47.070
Right.

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:48.980
Go.

00:11:54.990 --> 00:11:58.600
Caesar's being obedient, 
like a borrowed cat.

00:11:58.600 --> 00:12:01.400
Really? Let me see.

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:03.450
I wonder how long he can keep it up.

00:12:04.350 --> 00:12:06.940
Hey, let me see.

00:12:06.940 --> 00:12:07.990
Nope.

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:23.140
I'm counting on you, Nobu.

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:26.110
Don't let him deceive you.

00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:32.710
Beautiful...

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:38.640
She is like a celestial being.

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:47.570
All the women of the East are beautiful.

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:52.530
How is the tea ceremony?

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:57.180
Everything is a new experience for me,
 so I am not sure what to think.

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:58.940
But...

00:12:59.770 --> 00:13:01.410
It has a formal beauty.

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:04.280
I do not mind the

00:13:05.230 --> 00:13:06.370
solemnity of it.

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:07.780
I see.

00:13:08.520 --> 00:13:12.330
I apologize for holding the tea 
ceremony in such a bleak landscape.

00:13:12.330 --> 00:13:14.240
We are in the midst of war.

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:16.060
It has a certain charm.

00:13:16.890 --> 00:13:18.060
Thank you.

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:22.520
This is an Oda family heirloom,

00:13:23.270 --> 00:13:24.860
the Bowl of Emptiness.

00:13:25.420 --> 00:13:26.520
Emptiness...

00:13:27.710 --> 00:13:30.480
It symbolizes how one may view 
things as having substance,

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:31.750
or being empty of it.

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:35.540
Neither view is more than 
one aspect of the truth.

00:13:36.190 --> 00:13:38.280
That is what this bowl embodies.

00:13:41.970 --> 00:13:42.930
Please take it.

00:13:51.860 --> 00:13:52.860
Brother?

00:13:53.120 --> 00:13:55.170
I called for this tea ceremony.

00:13:55.170 --> 00:13:56.610
I can have it be my way.

00:13:57.240 --> 00:13:58.980
If we're too stuck on formalities,

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:00.270
we can't enjoy the tea!

00:14:00.930 --> 00:14:02.600
We can be free about it!

00:14:03.890 --> 00:14:04.880
Free...

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:07.080
Nonconformity...

00:14:07.640 --> 00:14:10.540
Well, with your permission.

00:14:37.920 --> 00:14:40.980
Do tea ceremonies exist on
 the Star of the West, as well?

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:44.330
None that require this much formality.

00:14:44.720 --> 00:14:47.730
The East has many customs.

00:14:47.730 --> 00:14:49.830
They must feel cumbersome to you.

00:14:49.830 --> 00:14:52.190
The West is no different.

00:14:53.190 --> 00:14:56.160
It is rather difficult to 
have a free-spirited life.

00:14:57.140 --> 00:15:00.430
Uh-oh. There he goes, complaining again.

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:04.370
King Arthur... that is whom you serve, no?

00:15:05.410 --> 00:15:07.250
He is very noble.

00:15:07.250 --> 00:15:09.100
I ask that you show him more respect.

00:15:10.360 --> 00:15:11.720
Who is he?

00:15:12.100 --> 00:15:13.870
Why do you wish to know?

00:15:13.870 --> 00:15:16.670
I have heard he rules the Star of the West.

00:15:17.240 --> 00:15:19.310
I wish to know what manner of man he is.

00:15:20.070 --> 00:15:21.060
I see.

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:23.990
Then I will tell you.

00:15:26.080 --> 00:15:27.820
King Arthur...

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:30.690
is the very Savior-King of this world!

00:15:32.670 --> 00:15:34.030
The Savior-King?

00:15:34.520 --> 00:15:36.800
Another Savior-King, besides Nobunaga?

00:15:39.180 --> 00:15:42.770
King Arthur aims to use the 
Regalia wielders' power

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:44.770
to manifest the Holy Grail,

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:51.680
then use its infinite power to save 
this world from certain destruction.

00:15:56.540 --> 00:16:01.190
And what if King Arthur 
cannot accomplish this goal?

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:05.690
The world will end.

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:08.630
So.

00:16:09.350 --> 00:16:10.920
Let us get down to business.

00:16:12.140 --> 00:16:13.620
For the reasons I just mentioned,

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:15.940
offer the Regalia to King Arthur.

00:16:16.860 --> 00:16:19.820
Offer all of them, 
including those of fire and wind

00:16:19.820 --> 00:16:21.920
you were given by Lord Shingen,

00:16:22.430 --> 00:16:25.750
then join your forces to mine.

00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:28.510
If you agree to these terms,

00:16:28.510 --> 00:16:32.110
I promise that the people 
of Oda will live in peace.

00:16:32.770 --> 00:16:33.880
Just as we'd thought...

00:16:34.370 --> 00:16:36.890
Nobu, this is a crucial moment.

00:16:37.090 --> 00:16:38.640
We can't give them up.

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:40.190
How can we?

00:16:40.720 --> 00:16:41.260
Nobu-sama!

00:16:42.490 --> 00:16:47.810
Furthermore, if the Oda lands 
face any external threat,

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:50.040
we swear to use 
our full might to repel them

00:16:50.430 --> 00:16:54.690
and to protect this land and your people.

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:11.430
Two lions are facing each other.

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:16.400
Neither has the slightest 
intention to retreat.

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:19.170
Will they come head to head?

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:26.870
Or will one of them leap 
high over the other?

00:17:30.970 --> 00:17:31.750
I refuse.

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:35.480
If I were to hand you the Regalia,

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:38.170
Caesar-dono, I do not doubt that you would

00:17:38.170 --> 00:17:39.990
protect my lands and people.

00:17:40.460 --> 00:17:43.140
But knowing the extent of your ambition,

00:17:43.690 --> 00:17:45.840
you would also attempt to seize the remaining

00:17:45.840 --> 00:17:47.660
lands of the Star of the East, no?

00:17:48.870 --> 00:17:52.010
If so, I cannot agree to that.

00:17:52.010 --> 00:17:54.140
You are mistaken.

00:17:54.510 --> 00:17:57.370
I do not need this parley.

00:17:57.710 --> 00:18:00.690
You are not the one who can save the world.

00:18:00.690 --> 00:18:03.380
That is King Arthur and he alone.

00:18:04.710 --> 00:18:05.880
That's not true!

00:18:06.210 --> 00:18:07.020
Not true!

00:18:07.650 --> 00:18:08.520
Ranmaru.

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:12.320
I saw a vision!

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:15.520
Nobunaga is the one who can save the world!

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:18.530
The Savior-King is Nobunaga!

00:18:18.750 --> 00:18:19.890
A vision?

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:22.630
Not King Arthur, but Nobunaga?

00:18:22.630 --> 00:18:24.030
Is that even possible?

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:26.800
Ah, <i>two</i> Savior-Kings...

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:29.270
What a surprise!

00:18:29.770 --> 00:18:30.790
Nobunaga-sama is...

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:32.310
There are two Savior-Kings...

00:18:34.370 --> 00:18:37.780
What a strange thing to say, Ranmaru.

00:18:44.860 --> 00:18:47.340
That will not change how I live.

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:50.190
I will just live as I will.

00:18:52.150 --> 00:18:54.090
I had been mistaken.

00:18:55.420 --> 00:18:59.740
Until now, I have always wanted power,
 a Giant War Armor unit.

00:19:00.670 --> 00:19:03.340
That is why I attacked the 
delivery ship from the West.

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:08.240
But now, more than the power itself,

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:11.980
I wish to have the ability to control it.

00:19:12.690 --> 00:19:14.290
An ability within myself.

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:17.410
The Star of the West

00:19:17.410 --> 00:19:21.320
must have been providing the Star 
of the East with Giant War Armors

00:19:21.320 --> 00:19:23.590
to find those with that ability.

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:25.860
Unaware of it all,

00:19:26.490 --> 00:19:28.860
we vied with each other.

00:19:30.330 --> 00:19:33.200
This time, it is you and me

00:19:33.200 --> 00:19:35.870
whose ability was tested to 
see whose was the greater.

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:39.100
Do you not think that
 was King Arthur's intent?

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:41.220
What do you mean by that?

00:19:41.220 --> 00:19:44.210
If we continue to wage war over the Regalia,

00:19:44.210 --> 00:19:46.650
we will continue to rain 
destruction upon this star.

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:48.650
And if I die,

00:19:48.650 --> 00:19:51.120
the king will lose a Regalia wielder.

00:19:51.740 --> 00:19:52.720
Am I wrong?

00:19:54.280 --> 00:19:56.390
Now is not that time for 
the two of us to fight.

00:19:57.200 --> 00:19:58.050
Nobu...

00:19:58.540 --> 00:20:01.200
Then, when will we settle the score?

00:20:01.660 --> 00:20:03.890
When I stand before Arthur.

00:20:04.900 --> 00:20:06.400
I see.

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:09.720
Then I will bring you to him someday.

00:20:10.360 --> 00:20:14.140
Until then, I propose a temporary alliance.

00:20:14.530 --> 00:20:16.090
As proof of my good intentions,

00:20:16.090 --> 00:20:18.650
I will protect the Oda 
territory with all my might.

00:20:22.790 --> 00:20:24.160
In exchange...

00:20:25.830 --> 00:20:28.920
I will have you give me Lady Ichihime.

00:20:29.800 --> 00:20:30.470
What?!

00:20:30.470 --> 00:20:31.430
Lady Ichihime?!

00:20:36.700 --> 00:20:40.440
I wish to have Lady Ichihime as my queen.

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:45.040
Damn you, Caesar!

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:48.040
How dare you think we would 
accept such a proposal?!

00:20:48.630 --> 00:20:50.010
How terrible!

00:20:50.010 --> 00:20:51.980
She would be as good as being a hostage!

00:20:53.580 --> 00:20:54.860
Please wait.

00:21:00.740 --> 00:21:07.400
I will respond personally to 
the matter of my own marriage.

00:21:24.160 --> 00:21:25.610
I

00:21:26.780 --> 00:21:28.250
gladly accept.

00:21:28.540 --> 00:21:29.720
Ichi... you...

00:21:29.720 --> 00:21:30.920
Ichihime!

00:21:32.840 --> 00:21:39.420
If I can save my brother,
 the Oda's lands, and people...

00:21:39.420 --> 00:21:43.220
no, the entire Star of the 
East, in exchange for my life,

00:21:43.220 --> 00:21:44.860
I will do so.

00:21:45.670 --> 00:21:46.600
But...

00:21:48.630 --> 00:21:52.220
But, if you fail to 
make good on your promise,

00:21:52.860 --> 00:21:55.380
I have resolved to end your life, 
even at the cost of my own.

00:21:56.630 --> 00:21:58.580
Are you still willing?

00:22:09.920 --> 00:22:11.280
The unwise one...

00:22:11.720 --> 00:22:13.700
The fool is Lady Ichihime?

00:22:29.240 --> 00:22:30.860
How ominous.

00:22:32.470 --> 00:22:34.620
What is that?

00:22:37.530 --> 00:22:39.030
Ichihime-sama.

00:24:12.170 --> 00:24:13.840
The flowers tremble in the rain,

00:24:13.840 --> 00:24:15.140
and vanish in silence.

00:24:15.750 --> 00:24:18.560
No, you will not vanish.

00:24:18.560 --> 00:24:19.400
Never.

00:24:20.240 --> 00:24:22.020
Next time: Swords.

00:24:22.660 --> 00:24:25.330
Starlight glimmers on midnight tears.
